        <mxCell id="n6" value="&lt;b&gt;Interfaz de chat&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;(Streamlit)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#B00020'&gt;session_id sin vínculo&lt;br&gt;fuerte a identidad&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1F3864;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#1F3864;fontSize=17;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
